  "releaseNotes": "InputSourceGetCommand and PlayViaModeGetCommand now return string identifiers symmetric with their Set counterparts (\"magicinfos\" / \"hdmi1\" / \"urllauncher\" / ...) instead of the raw byte cast to a single ASCII char. Unknown codes return \"0x<hex>\". InputSources extended with Dvi, DviVideo, Hdmi1Pc, Hdmi2Pc, DisplayPort per MDC spec section 2.1.14. New PlayViaModes constants (MagicInfo, UrlLauncher, MagicIwb) per MDC spec section 2.1.C7.81.",
